      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tWe're finally on planet Lionech! StEVEN told us he cleared the area
        and brought some alien speciments to the lab. They look... unsettling. There
        is something disturbingly human-like about them. Ugh.\n\r\n\tI'm sitting
        inside the base, waiting for Yukari and StEVEN to return. Lucky ones. Their
        android bodies are immune to the radiation. Meanwhile I'm stuck inside these
        four walls.\n\r\n\tAt least there are some cacti inside to keep me company.
        I always liked these plants, their shape and ease of maintaining. I don't
        know why, but examining them makes me calm and happy."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
